        "func": "// Force the metrics to be strict Numbers (InfluxDB will reject strings)\nlet safeTemp = Number(msg.payload.temperature_c);\nlet safeConf = Number(msg.payload.confidence);\nlet safeSymptom = msg.payload.symptom || \"unknown\";\n\n// Format for InfluxDB: [ {fields}, {tags} ]\nmsg.payload = [{\n    temperature: safeTemp, \n    confidence: safeConf\n},\n{\n    symptom: safeSymptom\n}];\n\nreturn msg;",
